t":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:48:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029562","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:52:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4995000-1847286114027036","game_id":"steam-4995000","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: reworked thermal camera and gamepad improvements","summary":"Thanks to everyone who played the demo during the festival and shared feedback — this update is built directly on it.Thermal camera (FLIR)Rebuilt from scratch. The ocean is no longer pitch black: it now reads as a mid-grey surface with visible waves, and the horizon stays clear against the dark sky.Objects have their own heat maps: exhausts and rotor tips glow, hulls stay cool, people stand out against the water.No more pure black in thermal view, so switching modes should be much easier on the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:52:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027036","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:14:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4995000-1846651706686673","game_id":"steam-4995000","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.1: Camera, Performance and New Hints","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the *DATUM: Rescue One* demo and shared feedback. We’ve read your comments, and this update addresses several of the issues you reported. Camera - The camera now pauses before moving back behind the helicopter, giving you more time to look around while flying. - During normal flight, the camera stays centered behind the helicopter. It shifts toward the hoist operator’s work area only when the searchlight is on. - Fixed an issue that could cause the camera to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:35:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686673","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4995000-1846651706681627","game_id":"steam-4995000","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo is out – try it before Steam Next Fest","summary":"The free demo of DATUM: Rescue One is now available on Steam!Take the controls of a naval search-and-rescue helicopter, fly a search pattern over open water, find the survivor and bring them aboard with the hoist. No flight sim experience or joystick required.The demo includes two missions:- a short daytime rescue that teaches the basics;- Advanced Mode, unlocked after the first mission: a night search with a random survivor position, starting from a cold engine on the ship's deck. The demo is a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:09:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681627","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4995000":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:29Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4995000":"2026-10-26T06:36:30Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4995000":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:29Z"},"5387600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:30Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4995000","app_id":4995000,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:15Z","source_url":"https://api.st